"commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor"
],
"explanation": "Based on Document 1, the filing of US patent 11331283 is explicitly described as a significant event involving pharmaceutical compositions comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and one or more binders. Based on Document 2, the commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor is described as an event where Dr. Rachel Kim was invited to attend in recognition of her work on a new pharmaceutical composition comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and binders, which was used to treat sailors. The additional extracted evidence confirms that the composition was involved in the commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor. Therefore, both the patent filing and the ship's commissioning ceremony are correct answers."
}

